sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as User or authorized host
  participant Entry as CLI / App / MCP
  participant Core as In-process Core
  participant Secret as Local secret store
  participant Adapter as In-process adapter
  participant Target as Appliance LAN or vendor cloud
  User->>Entry: Explicit operation
  Entry->>Core: Command + trusted principal + deadline
  Core->>Core: Resolve identity and validate capability, arguments, policy
  Core->>Secret: Request session access on demand
  Secret-->>Core: Restricted credential access
  Core->>Core: Select one write route and persist pending phase
  Core->>Adapter: execute(validated command)
  Adapter->>Target: Protocol request
  alt Explicit acceptance
    Target-->>Adapter: ACK
    Adapter-->>Core: accepted
    Core->>Adapter: Verify within remaining budget
    Adapter->>Target: read
    Target-->>Adapter: Observations, timestamps, sources
    Adapter-->>Core: Normalized observations
    Core-->>Entry: verified or accepted
  else Possibly sent but acknowledgement lost
    Adapter-->>Core: possibly_sent
    Core-->>Entry: unknown; no blind cross-route replay
  else Explicit rejection or proven-unsent failure
    Adapter-->>Core: rejected / not_sent
    Core-->>Entry: failed
  end
  Entry-->>User: Structured outcome
  Core->>Core: Save redacted result and release operation resources
  Note over Entry,Core: CLI exits; App retains UI; MCP awaits its host. No background polling.
